+# Score Easy — Verified Backlog & Implementation Plan
+
+## Executive summary
+
+This backlog is the trustworthy, post-verification distillation of the Score Easy audit. Every surviving item has been confirmed against the **current** source (the audit's recurring failure mode was finder line-refs drifting from refactored code, so file:line below uses the **corrected** locations from verification, not the stale catalogue refs).
+
+- **Raw findings: 89** (P0: 7, P1: 21, P2: 28, P3: 33).
+- **Survived verification as real: 79** (confirmed + partial). These are the work items.
+- **Dropped as false-positives: 10** — see the next section so nobody re-files them.
+- **Build + tests stay green** (44 files / 402 tests). A claim that contradicts a green test was treated as suspect; where a test *locks in* a bug (P0-3), that is called out explicitly.
+
