+## Confirmed false-positives (dropped)
+
+Do not re-file these. Each was checked against current code and found to not hold (or to be unreachable / inverted).
+
+| ID | Title | Why it's a false-positive |
+|----|-------|---------------------------|
+| P0-2 | No-draw goals match auto-saves `winner:'draw'` | All 3 completion paths are guarded via `getBasketballCompletionState({drawAllowed})` → tie in a no-draw sport yields overtime, never a saved `'draw'`. Finder cited wrong lines and missed the guard. |
+| P1-2 | Tournament scoring not persisted per point | Tournament scorers **do** autosave every point (`MonoSetsLiveScore.jsx:296-313`), restored on mount; a green test asserts it. Only residual: `mobile/lifecycle.js` is unwired dead code (low). |
+| P1-3 | Cricket-test has no autosave; reload wipes match | Continuous autosave effect exists (`MonoCricketTestLiveScore.jsx:517-539`); restore on load. There is no "Pause-only" save. Cited lines were pre-refactor. |
+| P1-5 | No sign-out control anywhere | The grep premise was wrong; a sign-out path exists. Central claim refuted. |
+| P1-19 | In-progress cricket-test drafts pollute history/stats | Both consumers call `loadCompletedQuickMatches()` which filters `status==='completed'` (`storage.js:397-399`). Drafts are excluded from History + Statistics totals. |
+| P2-12 | KO score-clear in GenericSetsTournament bypasses undo flow | `deleteKnockoutScore` (`GenericSetsTournament.jsx:138-146`) is dead code — zero call sites, no Clear control in `KnockoutMatchCard`. No user can trigger it. Residual: dead-code smell only (low). |
+| P2-13 | Knockout seeding produces permanent TBD when standings shorter than advancing count | Unreachable: `standings.length === teams.length` always (builders `teams.map`), `teamsAdvancing ≤ teamCount` always (clamped in setup), no import/migration fabricates a mismatch. Byes are wired (green `roundRobin.test.js`). |
+| P3-11 | "Resumed your in-progress match" banner is persistent, no dismiss | It is a transient self-clearing toast: JS `setTimeout(...,3300)` (`MonoQuickMatch.jsx:359-365`) + CSS `mono-note-toast 3300ms` (`mono.css:953-974`). Auto-dismiss already handled. |
+| P3-12 | `/play` shows category tabs with wrong order; "Net Sports" has 1 item | Live `/play` (`MonoPlayHub`) renders only Guided/Browse tabs; categories are sections (not tabs); the single-item Net Sports section is filtered out (volleyball is a priority sport). The only category-tabs file is dead code. |
+| P3-21 | Cricket extras un-addable at over/innings boundary | Inverted premise: only legal balls increment the count, so `balls >= totalBalls` is true exactly when the innings is genuinely over. Extras always recorded before the cap. Correct cricket behavior. |
